# estop.hal — Emergency stop loop
#
# TODO: wire to a real E-stop chain. For now, loopback so the machine
# can be brought online for bring-up. Replace lcec.din or a physical
# estop button input for production.

# Estop loopback: iocontrol enable out -> iocontrol enable in
net estop-loop iocontrol.0.user-enable-out iocontrol.0.emc-enable-in

# Drive fault reset: motion enables -> drive controlword handled by lcec internally.
# lcec basic_cia402 manages the CiA402 state machine (enable/fault reset) via
# srv-cia-controlword. For manual fault reset, wire a HAL pin:
# net fault-reset-x  halui.estop.activate  =>  ... (customize as needed)
